			"notes": "## Emerald Workbench\n\nEnchance your gear further with the **Emerald Workbench**, a brand new reforge station and the jobsite block for the **Emeraldsmith**\n\n## New Features\n\n- New Emerald Workbench UI\n- 12 Qualities for gear\n- Compatible with all Swords, Axes, and other **weapons**\n- 3 new Advancements\n\n## Balance Changes\n- Emerald Workstation Recipe updated to requir 2 Emerald Blocks and 4 Planks of any type\n- Emeraldsmith trade rebalance\n\n## What's Changed\n* Add Emerald Workbench functionality by @Priestytheplushie in https://github.com/Priestytheplushie/AVillagersDream/pull/1\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Priestytheplushie/AVillagersDream/compare/0.2.0...0.3.0"
